CodeDesk Server Debian source package
=====================================

Build from the root of a fresh, ordinary CodeDesk clone. No submodule checkout
or repository-external hbb_common source is required.

    server/debian/build.sh

The script creates a disposable source tree under target/debian containing
server/, libs/hbb_common/, and the Debian metadata, then runs dpkg-buildpackage.
The Cargo build is always invoked with server/Cargo.toml and server/Cargo.lock.

Required tools include dpkg-dev, debhelper, cargo, rustc, pkg-config,
libssl-dev, and libsodium-dev. Generated packages are written under
target/debian/.
